,"show_tab_icon":true,"tab_icon_svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"bi bi-suit-heart-fill\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\">\n  <path d=\"M4 1c2.21 0 4 1.755 4 3.92C8 2.755 9.79 1 12 1s4 1.755 4 3.92c0 3.263-3.234 4.414-7.608 9.608a.513.513 0 0 1-.784 0C3.234 9.334 0 8.183 0 4.92 0 2.755 1.79 1 4 1\"><\/path>\n<\/svg>","tab_icon_size":19,"content_layout":"two_column","first_content_type":"text","first_title":"Her'dration - Clean Electrolytes + Hormone & Mood Support","first_text_content":"<p>Her’dration is for women who are tired of feeling drained, foggy, or out of balance. It pairs mineral-rich electrolytes for proper hydration with functional ingredients that support calmer mood, clearer thinking, steadier energy, and better hormonal balance. Many women struggle due to PMS, PCOS, and menopause — this blend is meant to be practical support you can rely on and actually enjoy drinking every day.<\/p>","first_bullet_points":"","first_benefits":"","second_content_type":"benefits_list","second_title":"Key Benefits","second_text_content":"","second_bullet_points":"","second_benefits":"Supports mood stability, Promotes hormone balance, Calms the mind, Hydrates & re-mineralizes the body,"}},"tab_cg3nhw":{"type":"tab","name":"Pro","settings":{"tab_title":"Pro'dration","show_tab_icon":true,"tab_icon_svg":"<svg viewbox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><g id=\"SVGRepo_bgCarrier\" stroke-width=\"0\"><\/g><g id=\"SVGRepo_tracerCarrier\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><\/g><g id=\"SVGRepo_iconCarrier\"> <path d=\"M21.37 36C22.82 30.75 27.89 27 33.73 27.62C39.29 28.21 43.71 32.9 43.99 38.48C44.06 39.95 43.86 41.36 43.43 42.67C43.17 43.47 42.39 44 41.54 44H11.7584C6.71004 44 2.92371 39.3814 3.91377 34.4311L9.99994 4H21.9999L25.9999 11L17.43 17.13L14.9999 14\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-miterlimit=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"r